<title>UK: Goldman sachs sets warrants on three German stocks.</title>
<headline>Goldman sachs sets warrants on three German stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs and Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued five million American-style call warrants each on shares of Schering AG, BASF AG and Daimler-Benz AG, lead manager Goldman Sachs and Co said.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   16.DEC.99		 PAYDATE	06.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUES/FFT/STUT	   MIN EXER LOT 100 * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE    SPOT REF  ISSUE     PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> SCHERING    170 DEM   154 DEM   2.11 DEM  24.09 PCT  7.30 TIMES</p>
<p> BASF	   70 DEM    62.20    0.60 DEM  22.19 PCT 10.37 TIMES</p>
<p> DAIMLER     140 DEM   122 DEM   1.48 DEM  26.88 PCT  8.24 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
